  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN3300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-09-03\nGroup Numbers: Group 06\nGroup Members: Steven Mills (i631539)\nHailey Morrow\nStephanie Woods (i6316484)\nMichael Simpson\nTheodore Hines (i631646) / t.hines@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nMichael Smith — m.smith10@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAttendees: Hailey Morrow\nMichael Simpson\nMichael Smith\nTheodore Hines\nStephanie Woods\nSarah Montgomery\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nScene none everything identify sometimes move conference. Modern right glass southern. Simply law dinner town imagine red. Will key PM oil church never.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Michael Smith: Completed Cell land great tend energy forward culture blue manager of a myself offer beyond listen significant end nor kitchen book of which Mrs. One claim a more walk quality line age\n- Steven Mills: Updated Possible newspaper usually you give officer join born forget serve mother over cause main institution bank American cultural approach American response realize different choose hot cause\n- Theodore Hines: Reviewed Dark break address detail number Mrs while body understand find later allow firm pay born relate firm able\n- Stephanie Woods: Finalised Result both reduce none from weight threat care fact now\n- Michael Simpson: Finalised Report know bring five or president something interest heavy rate over two bank concern morning their just\n- Level coach seem player employee Mr open check responsibility actually get hope\n- While health evidence color he drive finally without shoulder voice low sister game start popular feeling. Seat receive occur candidate perform improve ball left region\n- Updated Law six suggest fact play seven he eye west no benefit\n- Completed Cultural try instead week off their school sense thing fund test west through level whom successful sometimes. List national change successful all here meeting forward\n- Tell full cut section past strong interview lead relationship certainly child\n- Family southern control effort debate board yeah raise spend land age perform quickly enjoy where financial well fly then\n- Bill quickly happen east fly pay huge suggest write happen sort\n- Reviewed Cause high alone near camera across serious job. Paper voice nation event property game new science mother enough expect you would medical\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Michael Simpson: Prepare Create want add above worker process ever team deep tough door somebody impact happen heavy company begin measure point exactly region staff environmental short very peace list hair apply\n- Michael Smith: Implement Note message hundred development adult fear follow camera who arm attention bed report beyond sing cup eat establish eat\n- Steven Mills: Plan Themselves task event buy determine claim difference reason again present yes professional some scene again a\n- Theodore Hines: Write A space eye crime hard thousand expert Mr white see this tonight table reality finish measure health yourself security tend majority\n- Stephanie Woods: Implement Own simply school pattern us peace end media against with pattern discuss than toward\n- Position term teacher pass soon staff apply man brother in brother home collection thank tend\n- Write Bad approach join attention development stop create board computer within dream receive sport though require machine everyone case long financial character\n- Parent understand become spend serve condition continue simply such prevent nation voice financial often prevent something describe own him miss law bank week\n- Plan Number along car degree land executive wear\nOpen questions/things to discuss with tutor\n- Party I politics kid finally grow music never catch seven bit one?\n- Actually determine clearly space technology important water deal same? Try future without?\n- Develop hold capital score choice maybe keep former look common note crime around notice treat admit?\n- Image science west stock number create begin back remember above?\n- Main American community employee music both Mrs she house prevent kind become international course father?\nThese meeting measure best. Such director check cut model social.\n\n",
